The Discover Program is designed to support small game creators by providing a platform to showcase their games without the hassle of ads or any associated costs. Our mission is to help you reach a wider audience while appreciating your trust in incorporating our assets into your game.

Program Requirements:
- Ensure your game aligns with our Terms of Service.
- Games should be suitable for all ages. (Subject to change)
- Donation Board Model: Incorporate the Donation Board Model within your game.

Discover Application
- Kindly provide your game name, and link to your Roblox game on our group wall, or Communication Server. [Alyths Corporation]
Join the Discover Program and let’s grow together while bringing amazing games to a wider audience!]]></string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>0.21176470816135406</R><G>0.21176470816135406</G><B>0.21176470816135406</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><token name="TextXAlignment">0</token><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>1</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>1</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><int name="ZIndex">4</int><BinaryString name="AttributesSerialize"></BinaryString><bool name="DefinesCapabilities">false</bool><BinaryString name="Tags"></BinaryString></Properties></Item></Item></Item><Item class="Frame" referent="2771"><Properties><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0.10588236153125763</R><G>0.16470588743686676</G><B>0.20784315466880798</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">2</int><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>-1</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.9300000071525574</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.9750000238418579</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.05999999865889549</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><int name="ZIndex">3</int><BinaryString name="AttributesSerialize"></BinaryString><bool name="DefinesCapabilities">false</bool><string name="Name"><![CDATA[Footer]]></string><BinaryString name="Tags"></BinaryString></Properties><Item class="UICorner" referent="2772"><Properties><UDim name="CornerRadius"><S>0</S><O>5</O></UDim><BinaryString name="AttributesSerialize"></BinaryString><bool name="DefinesCapabilities">false</bool><BinaryString name="Tags"></BinaryString></Properties></Item><Item class="Frame" referent="2773"><Properties><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0.10588236153125763</R><